  "currentWritePolicy": "Hugo5 and Window5 replace the next ordinary position, use its stock/factor/spool and clear reward, credit the complete board once, and advance to the following position. There are exactly ten positions. A trigger on position ten records its witness but starts no eleventh board. Hugo1/2/3/4 and Window1/2/3/4 retain exact published interlude seeds, progression and scores; prepared Hugo3 continues unchanged. No schema, SQL, row shape, ranking, season or badge-trigger change."
